# Language policy for Promo Count

## Site and repository (English only)

Everything that belongs to the website or its repository must be in English:

- UI copy, marketing text, legal pages, alt text, ARIA labels
- Commit messages and PR titles/descriptions
- README, docs, comments, TODOs, error messages, logs
- GitHub Actions workflow names and step names
- Branch names when practical

Do not add Persian (Farsi) or other non-English text to the codebase, commits, or CI output.

## Cursor chat with the user

Replies to the user in this chat may be in Persian when the user writes in Persian.
Keep technical identifiers (paths, commands, URLs, commit SHAs) in English as usual.
